ns/ttml">te</span></text><text for="L59"><span begin="03:33.361" end="03:33.643" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kyou</span><span begin="03:33.643" end="03:34.241" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mo</span><span begin="03:34.581" end="03:34.770" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">hi</span><span begin="03:34.770" end="03:34.961" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ga</span><span begin="03:34.961" end="03:35.371" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ku</span><span begin="03:35.898" end="03:36.674" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">reru</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans-CN"><text for="L1">散落在我脚边的只言片语</text><text for="L2">我将其拾起收集 拼凑到一起</text><text for="L3">想着这会不会</text><text for="L4">成为有意义的话语呢</text><text for="L5">我就这样 献上了自己的人生</text><text for="L6">不分昼夜</text><text for="L7">在烈日下尽情舞蹈吧 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(一二三)</span></text><text for="L8">若是受伤 便安然入睡吧</text><text for="L9">没空为没带伞而哀叹</text><text for="L10">在雨中放声歌唱吧</text><text for="L11">只因我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L12">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L13">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L14">来吧 睁开双眼</text><text for="L15">只因我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L16">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L17">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L18">向着遥远的新天地</text><text for="L19">背负的夕阳只剩一半</text><text for="L20">剩下的一半 化作明天的希望</text><text for="L21">眼中流下的一行泪水</text><text for="L22">假装用右手遮挡阳光</text><text for="L23">遮住了自己的视线</text><text for="L24">为什么大家</text><text for="L25">总在奢求没有的东西</text><text for="L26">却让拥有的东西渐渐腐坏</text><text for="L27">在烈日下尽情舞蹈吧 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(一二三)</span></text><text for="L28">若是受伤 便安然入睡吧</text><text for="L29">没空为没带伞而哀叹</text><text for="L30">在雨中放声歌唱吧</text><text for="L31">只因我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L32">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L33">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L34">来吧 睁开双眼</text><text for="L35">只因我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L36">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L37">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L38">向着遥远的新天地</text><text for="L39">在黎明歌唱 赞美黄昏</text><text for="L40">在暮光中 我们寄予信赖</text><text for="L41">当暗影降临 潜入光芒之中 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(潜入光芒之中)</span></text><text for="L42">当地平线呼唤 我们的梦想永不熄灭 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(我们的梦想永不熄灭)</span></text><text for="L43">梦想永不熄灭</text><text for="L44">在烈日下尽情舞蹈吧</text><text for="L45">若是受伤 便安然入睡吧 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊啊啊)</span></text><text for="L46">没空为没带伞而哀叹 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(哦哦 没有空闲)</span></text><text for="L47">在雨中放声歌唱吧 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊哦哦 啊哦)</span></text><text for="L48">只因我是地平线梦想家 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(欸)</span></text><text for="L49">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L50">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L51">我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L52">来吧 睁开双眼 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(睁开双眼)</span></text><text for="L53">只因我是地平线梦想家</text><text for="L54">我是地平线梦想家 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(喔)</span></text><text for="L55">我是地平线梦想家 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊啊 哦哦)</span></text><text for="L56">向着遥远的新天地</text><text for="L57">散落在我脚边的只言片语</text><text for="L58">我将其拾起收集</text><text for="L59">今天 太阳也照常落下</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:36.674"><div begin="00:08.175" end="00:19.498" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="00:08.175" end="00:11.604" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:08.175" end="00:09.074">足</span><span begin="00:09.074" end="00:09.505">元</span><span begin="00:09.505" end="00:09.763">に</span><span begin="00:09.763" end="00:10.545">散らばる</span><span begin="00:10.545" end="00:11.604">言葉</span></p><p begin="00:15.337" end="00:19.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:15.337" end="00:15.931">拾</span><span begin="00:15.931" end="00:16.281">い</span><span begin="00:16.281" end="00:16.914">集め</span><span begin="00:16.914" end="00:17.626">つなぎ</span><span begin="00:17.626" end="00:18.064">合わ</span><span begin="00:18.064" end="00:19.498">せた</span></p></div><div begin="00:22.669" end="00:37.988" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:22.669" end="00:25.332" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:22.669" end="00:23.511">何か</span><span begin="00:23.511" end="00:24.071">意味</span><span begin="00:24.495" end="00:24.667">の</span><span begin="00:24.667" end="00:25.332">ある</span></p><p begin="00:25.332" end="00:29.569" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:25.332" end="00:25.816">文</span><span begin="00:26.288" end="00:26.751">章</span><span begin="00:26.751" end="00:27.218">に</span><span begin="00:27.218" end="00:27.671">なる</span><span begin="00:27.671" end="00:28.139">ん</span><span begin="00:28.139" end="00:28.350">じゃ</span><span begin="00:28.350" end="00:29.041">ない</span><span begin="00:29.041" end="00:29.241">か</span><span begin="00:29.241" end="00:29.569">と</span></p><p begin="00:29.967" end="00:34.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:29.967" end="00:30.081">そう</span><span begin="00:30.081" end="00:30.730">思い</span><span begin="00:30.847" end="00:31.747">人生</span><span begin="00:31.747" end="00:31.917">を</span><span begin="00:31.917" end="00:32.576">捧</span><span begin="00:32.576" end="00:34.880">げた</span></p><p begin="00:34.880" end="00:37.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:34.880" end="00:35.609">朝</span><span begin="00:35.609" end="00:35.809">も</span><span begin="00:35.809" end="00:36.626">夜</span><span begin="00:36.626" end="00:37.988">も</span></p></div><div begin="00:38.631" end="00:54.108" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="00:38.631" end="00:43.154" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:38.631" end="00:39.089">(One </span><span begin="00:39.089" end="00:39.563">two </span><span begin="00:39.563" end="00:39.789">three)</span></span> <span begin="00:39.709" end="00:40.641">太陽</span><span begin="00:40.641" end="00:40.762">に</span><span begin="00:40.762" end="00:41.930">焼かれて</span><span begin="00:41.930" end="00:42.572">踊り</span><span begin="00:42.572" end="00:43.154">ましょう</span></p><p begin="00:43.354" end="00:46.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:43.354" end="00:43.850">傷つ</span><span begin="00:43.850" end="00:44.736">いたら</span><span begin="00:44.736" end="00:45.522">眠り</span><span begin="00:45.522" end="00:46.705">ましょう</span></p><p begin="00:46.992" end="00:50.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:46.992" end="00:47.405">傘</span><span begin="00:47.405" end="00:47.646">が</span><span begin="00:47.646" end="00:48.126">ない</span><span begin="00:48.126" end="00:48.353">と</span><span begin="00:48.353" end="00:48.952">嘆</span><span begin="00:48.952" end="00:49.244">く</span><span begin="00:49.244" end="00:49.664">暇</span><span begin="00:49.664" end="00:49.882">は</span><span begin="00:49.882" end="00:50.451">ない</span></p><p begin="00:50.587" end="00:54.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:50.587" end="00:51.069">雨</span><span begin="00:51.069" end="00:51.289">に</span><span begin="00:51.289" end="00:51.938">打たれ</span><span begin="00:51.938" end="00:52.793">歌い</span><span begin="00:52.793" end="00:54.108">ましょう</span></p></div><div begin="00:54.211" end="01:09.711" itunes:songPart="Hook"><p begin="00:54.211" end="00:56.304" ttm:agent="v2000" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:54.211" end="00:54.452">Cause </span><span begin="00:54.452" end="00:54.681">I'm </span><span begin="00:54.681" end="00:54.934">a </span><span begin="00:54.934" end="00:55.791">horizon </span><span begin="00:55.791" end="00:56.304">dreamer</span></p><p begin="00:56.304" end="00:58.115" ttm:agent="v2000" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:56.304" end="00:56.492">I'm </span><span begin="00:56.492" end="00:56.733">a </span><span begin="00:56.733" end="00:57.525">horizon </span><span begin="00:57.525" end="00:58.115">dreamer</span></p><p begin="00:58.115" end="01:0